<title>FRANCE: French public service safe from selloff - Chirac.</title>
<headline>French public service safe from selloff - Chirac.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will privatise all state companies operating in the competitive sector but this will not touch the public service, President Jacques Chirac said in a television interview on Thursday evening.</p>
<p>&quot;All companies operating in the competitive sector will be privatised because there is no reason for the state to remain involved in their management. And I say the competitive sector,&quot; Chirac said.</p>
<p>&quot;The public service 'a la francaise' is untouchable,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
